  "method": "Three sequential independent processes per variant, Python 3.14.7, temporary directories and synthetic accepted trades only. fsync is enabled. 281 codes x 1 venue x 54 retained seconds = 15174 bars. Each idle phase uses the median of seven repeats. All journal/checkpoint files are normalized and hashed after sparse and active/expiry phases.",
