  ],
  "limits": [
    "Not a production WS/network/GC latency benchmark; the live API and capture daemons were not changed or restarted.",
    "The four-call phase compares shared-store work, not the new single scheduler lifecycle; lifecycle and cancellation are tested separately.",
    "More indexing is maintained on new-bar ingest; additional CPU/memory is visible in the raw samples. Existing max_cells still bounds retained keys.",
    "Checkpoint digest excludes the file byte offset and normalizes row order; actual offset/restart behavior is verified by separate fault and recovery tests.",
    "Power loss before an unflushed revision reaches fsync has the same existing durability limit."
